sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Strategy/AI/User
  participant K as Policy Kernel
  participant R as Independent Risk Gate
  participant L as Ledger
  participant G as Execution Guard
  participant A as Privileged Adapter
  participant V as Venue/Wallet/Chain
  participant C as Reconciliation

  S->>K: Typed versioned proposal
  K->>K: Validate tenant/env/action/policy/legal
  alt denied or legal review required
    K-->>S: DENIED / REQUIRES_LEGAL_REVIEW
  else policy acceptable
    K->>R: Risk evaluation
    R-->>K: ALLOW or DENY
    alt economic lock required and all gates allow
      K->>L: Authorized AccountingCommand (post once)
      L-->>K: AccountingEvent + local outbox record
    end
    K->>G: Authorized privileged request
    G->>G: Recheck signed auth, capability, expiry, revocation, replay, env attestation
    alt mismatch
      G-->>K: DENIED; bounded audit telemetry
    else valid
      G->>A: Scoped adapter command
      A->>V: External delivery attempt
      V-->>A: Untrusted observation / unknown result
      A-->>C: Correlated evidence fact
      C-->>L: Never direct balance mutation
      C-->>K: Correction proposal only if required
    end
  end
